  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tov_adonai_leqovav">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/1"/>Adonoy is good to those who hope for Him,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/2"/>to the soul who seeks Him.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/3"/>Our humiliation is before us all the day,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/4"/>our faces are covered with shame.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/44/23"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/5"/>We are murdered for Your sake, all the day,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/6"/>we are considered like sheep for slaughter.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/44/19"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/7"/>Yet our hearts are not turned away,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/8"/>nor are our feet moved from Your path.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/9/13"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/9"/>For He is concerned for the bloodshed,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/10"/>of them He is mindful;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tov_adonai_leqovav/11"/>He has not forgotten the cry of the humble.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
